---
import TopicLayout from "../../layouts/TopicLayout.astro";
---

<TopicLayout slug="hell">
  <p class="lede hell-opening-title">
    <b>"A picture is worth a thousand words"</b>
  </p>
  <p class="hell-opening-copy">
    And yet the one above still manages to fall short of the gravity of the
    eternal agony of damnation.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li class="hell-bubble">
      <p>
        <b>John 3:16</b><br />
        &ldquo;For God so loved the world that he gave his one and only Son, that
        whoever believes in him shall not perish but have eternal life.&rdquo;
      </p>

      <p>
        This verse speaks of love and hope for humanity, but it also reveals the
        reason for the dire need of love and hope for humanity.
      </p>
      <p>
        The verse implies that whoever does not believe in Jesus Christ, the Son
        of God, will perish and have eternal death.
      </p>
      <p class="interlude">
        The implication is true.<br />
        The reality horrifying.
      </p>
      <p>
        This horrifying reality, this &ldquo;living&rdquo; eternal death is
        infamously known as Hell.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p class="lede">
    <b
      >Take a closer look at our topic, but by all means avoid it being your
      destiny.</b
    >
  </p>

  <section class="hell-subtopics" aria-label="Hell topics">
    <div class="hell-subtopic-grid">
      <a href="/topics/hell/god-the-judge/" class="hell-subtopic-card hell-subtopic-card-judge" data-astro-prefetch>
        <span class="hell-subtopic-number">01</span>
        <h3>God the Judge</h3>
      </a>
      <a href="/topics/hell/description/" class="hell-subtopic-card hell-subtopic-card-description" data-astro-prefetch>
        <span class="hell-subtopic-number">02</span>
        <h3>Hell&rsquo;s Description</h3>
      </a>
      <a href="/topics/hell/do-you-qualify/" class="hell-subtopic-card hell-subtopic-card-qualify" data-astro-prefetch>
        <span class="hell-subtopic-number">03</span>
        <h3>Do You Qualify</h3>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>WHO DESERVES SUCH A SEVERE JUDGMENT?</h2>

  <p class="lede"><b>You. I. Everyone.</b></p>
  <p>
    If you don't agree with this being a justified condemnation, you are not
    aware of the height of the purity of God, nor the depth of your own
    depravity.
  </p>
  <p>We are in the realm of human.</p>
  <p>God is in the realm of God.</p>
  <p>
    What would make us think that we are even capable of earning a spot in His
    Presence?
  </p>

  <p class="interlude">
    "Morality may keep you out of jail, but it takes the blood of Jesus to keep
    you out of hell."<br />
    - Charles Spurgeon
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <b>Matthew 16:24-26</b><br />
      &ldquo;Then Jesus said to his disciples, &lsquo;Whoever wants to be my disciple
      must deny themselves and take up their cross and follow me. For whoever wants
      to save their life will lose it, but whoever loses their life for me will find
      it. What good will it be for someone to gain the whole world, yet forfeit their
      soul? Or what can anyone give in exchange for their soul?&rsquo;&rdquo;
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p class="scripture-credit">
    Scripture taken from the Holy Bible, NEW INTERNATIONAL VERSION&reg;,
    NIV&reg; Copyright &copy; 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.&reg; Used
    by permission. All rights reserved worldwide.
  </p>

</TopicLayout>

<style>
  .hell-opening-title {
    margin-top: -1.25rem;
  }

  .hell-opening-copy {
    margin-bottom: 3.25rem;
  }

  .hell-subtopics {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .hell-subtopic-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .hell-subtopic-card {
    display: flex;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 15rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    color: white;
    isolation: isolate;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    align-items: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  /* Replace these background-image values when the final card images are selected. */
  .hell-subtopic-card-judge {
    background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(20 11 10 / 0.25), rgb(20 11 10 / 0.78)),
      url('../../assets/topics/hell.jpg');
    background-position: center;
  }

  .hell-subtopic-card-description {
    background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(27 11 8 / 0.25), rgb(27 11 8 / 0.8)),
      url('../../assets/topics/hell.jpg');
    background-position: center 70%;
  }

  .hell-subtopic-card-qualify {
    background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(18 12 9 / 0.22), rgb(18 12 9 / 0.8)),
      url('../../assets/topics/Hell_pied.webp');
    background-position: center;
  }

  .hell-subtopic-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .hell-subtopic-number {
    color: #ffd38a;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .hell-subtopic-card h3 {
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    color: inherit;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hell-subtopic-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

</style>
